aurant, each holding a Whopper, seats are pulled out, and a burst of light indicates the Burger King's famous \"I'm lovin' it\" sign flashing in their eyes.]\n\nNarrator (celebrating): \"Heroes, gamers, and game-changers from across the board... It's time for a classic victory touch with Burger King's Whopper!\"\n\n[Cut to: The trio sitting down, trophies, and game controllers next to their Whoppers, finishing their meals with satisfaction.]\n\nNarrator: \"Who dares eat here must do so with a sense of adventure, whether it's in the shadows or on a quest. Burger King, where legends eat!\"\n\n[Closing Scene: The Whopper logo swirls with the characters, the BK sign rotating as the title fades in.]\n\nTitle: Burger King\n\n[End with the famous \"I'm lovin' it\" tagline and iconic BK logo.]\n\nNarrator: \"I'm lovin' it!\"\n\n[Cut to black, music fades out.]\n\n---\n\nSwitchConversation"}, {"key": [392, 5, "iso"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -0.04942051921988637, "log_surv_s": -0.05004724212091214, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [392, 5, "iso"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -0.00019859866415004312, "log_surv_s": -0.0003586264959838844, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [415, 1, "full"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -0.0001106080932937597, "log_surv_s": -0.00022334444881168947, "gen_len": 438, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [415, 1, "full"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -0.0014382604505385995, "log_surv_s": -0.0014538509369432836, "gen_len": 395, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [415, 1, "full"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -2.280980523228076e-06, "log_surv_s": -6.121860032815482e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [415, 1, "full"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -0.0001613238387195712, "log_surv_s": -0.0001739399383434631, "gen_len": 476, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [415, 1, "iso"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -2.9165341006761923e-06, "log_surv_s": -7.065119024280068e-06, "gen_len": 299, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [415, 1, "iso"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -4.0827